{"path":"string/wide/iswctype","title":"std::iswctype","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>iswctype","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/string/wide/iswctype","section":"string","kind":"page","summary":"Classifies the wide character wc using the current C locale's LC_CTYPE category identified by desc.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/cwctype\">&lt;cwctype&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">int</span> iswctype<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/wide\"><span class=\"kw3619\">std::<span class=\"me2\">wint_t</span></span></a> wc, <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/wide\"><span class=\"kw3618\">std::<span class=\"me2\">wctype_t</span></span></a> desc <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Classifies the wide character <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">wc</span></code> using the current C locale's <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/LC_categories\">LC_CTYPE</a></span> category identified by <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">desc</span></code>.\n</p><p>If the value of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">wc</span></code> is neither representable as a <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">wchar_t</span></span></code> nor equal to the value of the macro <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">WEOF</span></code>, the behavior is undefined.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> wc\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the wide character to classify\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> desc\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/LC_categories\">LC_CTYPE</a></span> category, obtained from a call to <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/wide/wctype\">std::wctype</a></span>\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>Non-zero if the character <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">wc</span></code> has the property identified by <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">desc</span></code> in <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/LC_categories\">LC_CTYPE</a></span> facet of the current C locale, zero otherwise.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;clocale&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cwctype&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> classify<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">wchar_t</span> wc, <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1237\">std::<span class=\"me2\">string</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> cat<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">iswctype</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>wc, <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/wide/wctype\"><span class=\"kw1200\">std::<span class=\"me2\">wctype</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>cat.<span class=\"me1\">c_str</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/setlocale\"><span class=\"kw2006\">std::<span class=\"me2\">setlocale</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/LC_categories\"><span class=\"kw2009\">LC_ALL</span></a>, <span class=\"st0\">\"ja_JP.UTF-8\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1774\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"The character <span class=\"es3\">\\u6c34</span> is...<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1237\">std::<span class=\"me2\">string</span></span></a> s <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"st0\">\"digit\"</span>, <span class=\"st0\">\"alpha\"</span>, <span class=\"st0\">\"space\"</span>, <span class=\"st0\">\"cntrl\"</span>, <span class=\"st0\">\"jkanji\"</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1774\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> s <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"? \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/boolalpha\"><span class=\"kw1780\">std::<span class=\"me2\">boolalpha</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> classify<span class=\"br0\">(</span>L<span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es3\">\\u6c34</span>'</span>, s<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>The character 水 is...\ndigit? false\nalpha? true\nspace? false\ncntrl? false\njkanji? true</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/wide/wctype\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>wctype</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  looks up a character classification category in the current C locale <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div class=\"t-dsc-see\"><span><a href=\"/w/c/string/wide/iswctype\">C documentation</a></span> for <span class=\"t-dsc-see-tt\"><span>iswctype</span></span></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"string","title":"Strings library"},{"path":"string/wide","title":"Null-terminated wide strings"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::iswctype","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Classifies the wide character wc using the current C locale's LC_CTYPE category identified by desc."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"wc, desc"},{"label":"Return value","note":"Non-zero if the character wc has the property identified by desc in LC_CTYPE facet of the current C locale, zero otherwise."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"wctype","note":"looks up a character classification category in the current C locale"}]}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":178,"codeBlockCount":2}
